CRISTEL ESCOTO posted a new assignment in English (Anglo-American  
Literature) 9-Einstein <https://classroom.google.com/c/MTkwMzg2ODI2MTg1>.

Due: Nov 2
Blackout Poetry
Refer on the link below for the guidelines in blackout poetry. Your output  
will be graded based on this rubric:
Content/Ideas- 5 pts
Poetic Elements- 5 pts
Presentation- 5 pts

Attach here the following:
1. Documentation (Drawing materials and the Text from where you've taken  
your poem)
2. A picture while holding your output
3. Blackout Poetry (scan or picture of your output; include also a word  
document on the content of it)

PS: If you wish to post it on your social media, do not include the subject  
in your caption. Keep safe and God bless!
